# pytest-mpl baseline images for the static (matplotlib) backend live here, one PNG per test in
# tests/static/test_image_baselines.py, named after the test function.
#
# Compare the current rendering against them:  pixi run -e dev test-images
# Regenerate them after a deliberate change:   pixi run -e dev test-images-generate
#
# Regenerating rewrites every PNG — review the image diff before committing it, and regenerate on the same
# OS the CI image-baselines job runs on (freetype rasterises text differently per platform).
